messages.content:
Project requirement: use the shared grid.css shell layout through data-grid="shell" instead of defining its auto / 1fr / auto layout in the component wrapper. Preserve the component class and supplied className.

Current JSX:
```tsx
<section className={`data-table-wrapper ${className}`}>
```

Current component CSS includes:
```css
.data-table-wrapper {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
}
```

Explain the focused correction.
